OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785322078
OL,3,CBurnham invites party leaders for
OL,4,Cmeeting over social care reform
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has invited party leaders
OL,7,FKemi Badenoch and Ed Davey to work
OL,8,Fwith him on tackling England's adult
OL,9,Fsocial care "head-on".
OL,11,FThe prime minister said successive
OL,12,Fgovernments have failed at reforming
OL,13,Fsocial care for decades, seeing the
OL,14,Fissue as "too risky, too difficult,
OL,15,Fand too complicated".
OL,17,FHe has asked the Conservative and
OL,18,FLiberal Democrat leaders to meet with
OL,19,Fhim on Wednesday to discuss the issue,
OL,20,Fafter declaring it to be one of the
OL,21,Fpriorities of his new government.
OL,26,@qD@MOUqD@UO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/11
