CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785322078
OL,3,CBurnham invites party leaders for
OL,4,Cmeeting over social care reform
OL,6,FBadenoch has already written to
OL,7,FBurnham to challenge him to rule out
OL,8,Ftax rises or increased borrowing to
OL,9,Fpay for a reform of the system, but
OL,10,Fwill be unable to attend the meeting.
OL,12,FThe shadow health secretary Stuart
OL,13,FAndrew will meet with Burnham in her
OL,14,Fplace, with a spokesperson for the
OL,15,FConservatives criticising the short
OL,16,Fnotice nature of the invite.
OL,18,FSubscribe free to our weekly
OL,19,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,20,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,21,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/11
