CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785322078
OL,3,CBurnham invites party leaders for
OL,4,Cmeeting over social care reform
OL,6,FDavey will attend on Wednesday and
OL,7,Fsaid ahead of the meeting "we need to
OL,8,Fdo things differently", noting that
OL,9,Ffamily carers "must be at the heart of
OL,10,Fany proposals".
OL,12,F"Everyone should be able to get care
OL,13,Fregardless of means, and no-one should
OL,14,Flose their home or life savings on
OL,15,Fcatastrophic care costs," Davey said.
OL,26,@oD@[OUpD@VO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785322078
OL,3,CBurnham invites party leaders for
OL,4,Cmeeting over social care reform
OL,6,FBurnham has previously stressed that
OL,7,Fhe wants to have cross-party talks,
OL,8,F"to build that spirit of collaboration
OL,9,Ffrom the start", while acknowledging
OL,10,Fthat change to social care will "take
OL,11,Ftime"
OL,13,FReform UK's leader Nigel Farage hit
OL,14,Fout at the PM for not extending the
OL,15,Finvite to his party, saying it "led
OL,16,Fover 300 national opinion polls and
OL,17,Frepresents thousands of councillors
OL,18,Fand millions of Britons across the
OL,19,Fcountry".
OL,26,@qD@OO]rD@aOUsD@EO]wD@`OU{D@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785322078
OL,3,CBurnham invites party leaders for
OL,4,Cmeeting over social care reform
OL,6,F"It's now clear that Burnham is
OL,7,Fconspiring behind closed doors with
OL,8,Fthe failed political establishment to
OL,9,Ffoist further tax rises on the
OL,10,Fcountry," said Farage, who is not
OL,11,Fcurrently an MP.
OL,13,FBurnham has repeatedly vowed to expend
OL,14,F"whatever political capital I have" on
OL,15,Ffixing the system, warning the NHS
OL,16,F"will collapse" otherwise.
OL,18,FHe will make a speech about the
OL,19,Freforms on Wednesday, although he is
OL,20,Fnot expected to lay-out details of a
OL,21,Fplan.
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOUvD@cO]xD@AOUxD@OO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785322078
OL,3,CBurnham invites party leaders for
OL,4,Cmeeting over social care reform
OL,6,F"Last week I said we needed a
OL,7,Fdifferent kind of politics: problem-
OL,8,Fsolving, not point-scoring. Nowhere is
OL,9,Fthat more urgent than social care,"
OL,10,FBurnham said ahead of the speech.
OL,12,F"For decades, governments have kicked
OL,13,Fthis issue down the road because
OL,14,Fthey've seen it as too risky, too
OL,15,Fdifficult, and too complicated.
OL,17,F"Politicians might have different
OL,18,Fviews but I'm serious about fixing
OL,19,Fthis issue and to do that, we have to
OL,20,Ffind common ground and listen to
OL,21,Fothers to find a way forward."
OL,26,@nD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785322078
OL,3,CBurnham invites party leaders for
OL,4,Cmeeting over social care reform
OL,6,FHe said reform of the sector "comes
OL,7,Fdown to a choice", adding: "We can
OL,8,Fcarry on passing the problem to the
OL,9,Fnext generation, or we can face it
OL,10,Fhead-on and work together to build a
OL,11,Fcare system that gives people dignity,
OL,12,Fsecurity and the support they deserve.
OL,14,F"This is about bringing back hope that
OL,15,Fwe can finally fix the difficult
OL,16,Fissues that have been ignored for too
OL,17,Flong, and making Britain believe
OL,18,Fagain. That's why I'm making this
OL,19,Fchoice and I'm prepared to put
OL,20,Feverything I've got behind it."
OL,26,@nD@^OUoD@QO]oD@\OUvD@AOU|D@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785322078
OL,3,CBurnham invites party leaders for
OL,4,Cmeeting over social care reform
OL,6,FThe government has already said there
OL,7,Fare "no plans" for a so-called "death
OL,8,Ftax" after reports Burnham might seek
OL,9,Fto put forward plans he had previously
OL,10,Fput forward while he was health
OL,11,Fsecretary in 2010.
OL,13,FAs part of the then-Labour government
OL,14,Funder Gordon Brown, Burnham had
OL,15,Fsuggested a levy to pay a proposed
OL,16,Fnational care service could take 10%
OL,17,Foff people's estates after they died.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30209
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785322078
OL,3,CBurnham invites party leaders for
OL,4,Cmeeting over social care reform
OL,6,FBaroness Louise Casey, who is leading
OL,7,Fa commission into social care, is
OL,8,Fexpected to announced her so-called
OL,9,F"Big Conversation on Care" on
OL,10,FWednesday, which will seek public
OL,11,Fopinion on what a social care system
OL,12,Fshould look like.
OL,14,FHer first report into the system will
OL,15,Fbe published later this year and the
OL,16,Ffinal, more detailed document, has
OL,17,Fbeen given a deadline of publication
OL,18,Fby 2028, which could be brought
OL,19,Fforward by Burnham.
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30210
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785322078
OL,3,CBurnham invites party leaders for
OL,4,Cmeeting over social care reform
OL,6,F"For too long, we have been stuck in
OL,7,Fthe same cycle: crisis, promises of
OL,8,Freform, another review, and then
OL,9,Fretreat, while the people who need
OL,10,Fcare, and their families, bear the
OL,11,Fbrunt," Baroness Casey said.
OL,13,F"Fixing adult social care is about far
OL,14,Fmore than money. People are already
OL,15,Fpaying for failure through council
OL,16,Ftax, pressure on the NHS, their
OL,17,Fsavings, giving up work, and the
OL,18,Fforced sale of their homes.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30211
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1785322078
OL,3,CBurnham invites party leaders for
OL,4,Cmeeting over social care reform
OL,6,F"The choice is whether we keep putting
OL,7,Fmoney into a system that is unfair,
OL,8,Funpredictable and broken, or have an
OL,9,Fhonest conversation about how to build
OL,10,Fsomething better.
OL,12,F"That is why we need a public
OL,13,Fconversation on care that tackles the
OL,14,Ftough questions. It's only by facing
OL,15,Fup to this problem together that we
OL,16,Fcan fix social care once and for all."
OL,18,FFrom Westminster to Washington DC -
OL,19,Four political experts are across all
OL,20,Fthe latest key talking points. Listen
OL,21,Fto the latest episode below...
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOU
